+/// command lines from `scripts/boot_flags.sh`): 45 `movzwl %ax,%eax` sites
+/// alone, 109 more `movzwl` than GCC emits for the same 21 translation
+/// units — see `scripts/boot_insn_census.py`.  Each fusion is 2 bytes.
